Subject: You have been invited to join Hooli Inc on Tanvo

==== text
Hello,

admin@hooli.test invited you to join Hooli Inc on Tanvo as Finance.

Accept the invitation: https://app.tanvo.test/invitation/invite-token

This invitation expires on Oct 17, 2024.

Thanks,
The Tanvo Team

--
You're receiving this email because someone invited this address to a Tanvo organization. If you weren't expecting it, you can ignore this email.

